drwxrwxr-x 7 andrzej andrzej 4096 Dec 13 10:18 . means:

drwxrwxr-x: Permissions (
    d = directory,
    rwx = read/write/execute for owner, 
    rwx for group,
    r-x for others)
7: Number of hard links (usually not important for most users)
andrzej: Owner of the directory
andrzej: Group owner
4096: Size in bytes (for directories, usually 4096)
Dec 13 10:18: Last modification date and time
. : The directory itself (the current directory)


PostgreSQL: How to log in and see tables on Ubuntu

1. Open a terminal on your Ubuntu server.
2. Log in to PostgreSQL as the postgres user:
    sudo -u postgres psql
    # Or, for a specific user/database:
    psql -U your_db_user -d your_db_name
3. List all databases:
    \l
4. Connect to your database:
    \c your_db_name
5. List all tables:
    \dt
6. To see the structure of a table:
    \d table_name
7. Exit psql:
    \q

